I. Making a NeoSTEAL kit
You will need one of these kits
A: 2 Cursed potions of gain level; or
B: Cursed potion of gain level & Cursed scroll of teleportation; or
C: 2 Cursed scrolls of teleportation.

Plus anything else you want to add. You will need to be as fast as you
can
II. Using a NeoSTEAL kit:
1 Get to the level before the last quest level.
2 Get to your quest nemesis and beat up anything that gets in your
way.
3 Wield Vorpal blade or Muramasa-sama if you have them.
4 Stand next to your nemesis.
5 Attack!
6 Hopefully you will get a double move; if you do quaff/read cursed
potion/scroll of gain level/teleportation.
If you don't get a double move, step away from your nemesis and
quaff/read cursed potion/scroll of gain level/teleportation.
Assuming you did get a double move, you and your nemesis should be on
one level and the artifact on another.
7 If your nemesis is not next to you, then quaff/read cursed
potion/scroll of gain level/teleportation.
8 Get to the quest level and get the artifact.

III. Using a NeoSTEAL kit vs. Rodney.
You will also need Teleport control.
You will need to be:
Fast enough to get a double move vs. Rodney. 
Stupid or insane enough to actually try this.
1 Get next to the Wizard of Yendor.
2 Wield vorpal blade or muramasa-sama if you have them.
3 Attack Rodney.
4 Hopefully you will get a double move. If you do quaff/read cursed
potion/scroll of gain level/teleportation.
If you don't, then running won't do much good, just fight.
5 Level teleport again.
6 Grab the Book of the Dead and run!
